shop! Whether you\u2019re here to craft the perfect drink or team up with friends to survive the rush, there\u2019s plenty to keep you busy.\n\n[h3]\ud83c\udfae Boba Cafe Simulator 2.0 is LIVE![\/h3]\n\n\u2728 A brand-new Customer Patience System \u2014 take it easy or test your skills during the rush!\n\ud83e\uddcb Try special Mid-Autumn Festival drinks! Their recipes and toppings are available until October 25!\n\ud83d\udcd6 20+ special recipes, plus plenty of other updates!\n\n[h2]\ud83c\udf42 Steam Cooking Fest Special![\/h2]\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 October 12\u201319\n\ud83c\udff7 20% OFF for a limited time!\n[b]\ud83d\udcb0 Regular price: $15.99 \u2192 Now just $12.79![\/b]\n\nRun your shop at your own pace, or invite your friends and see if you can survive a full-blown order rush together! \ud83d\udc40\n\nNow\u2019s a great time to grab the game and start brewing!&quot;,&quot;commentcount&quot;:0,&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;mod_reviewed&quot;,&quot;ModAct_1866137740_1791877434_0&quot;],&quot;language&quot;:0,&quot;hidden&quot;:0,&quot;forum_topic_id&quot;:&quot;592943924842209825&quot;,&quot;event_gid&quot;:&quot;698778060405607739&quot;,&quot;voteupcount&quot;:0,&quot;votedowncount&quot;:0,&quot;ban_check_result&quot;:0,&quot;banned&quot;:0},&quot;published&quot;:1,&quot;hidden&quot;:0,&quot;rtime32_visibility_start&quot;:0,&quot;rtime32_visibility_end&quot;:0,&quot;broadcaster_accountid&quot;:0,&quot;follower_count&quot;:0,&quot;ignore_count&quot;:0,&quot;forum_topic_id&quot;:&quot;592943924842209825&quot;,&quot;rtime32_last_modified&quot;:1791877435,&quot;news_post_gid&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;rtime_mod_reviewed&quot;:1791877435,&quot;featured_app_tagid&quot;:0,&quot;referenced_appids&quot;:[],&quot;build_id&quot;:0,&quot;build_branch&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;unlisted&quot;:0,&quot;rtime_created&quot;:1791877145,&quot;votes_up&quot;:0,&quot;votes_down&quot;:0,&quot;comment_type&quot;:&quot;ForumTopic&quot;,&quot;gidfeature&quot;:&quot;591780787069893698&quot;,&quot;g